#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0348-B expect=skipped domain=PC
#note "THE R-4.11 HOIST PIN (top-level-or board wave 2, group J): the pre-split var_exists guard is hoisted to Requirements.Variables.All [PCELTM], so a PC dataset without the column SKIPs, naming the variable, instead of executing silently (the Fix #331 empty-under-gate shape). DISCRIMINATOR: PCNOMDY is present and empty on row 1 - that is CDISC-SEND-0348's state, reported there and never here. If this EXECUTES, the hoisted gate has been removed - escalate, do not rewrite."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset PC class=FINDINGS label="Pharmacokinetics Concentrations"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col PCSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col PCTESTCD type=Char label="Test Short Name"
col PCNOMDY type=Num label="PC Timing Variable"
---
S1 | PC | 001 | 1 | DRUGX | .
S1 | PC | 001 | 2 | DRUGX | 1
